# Unit12
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit12核心词汇

original/əˈrɪdʒənl/原始的；独创的/The original painting is in the museum.
outcome/ˈaʊtkʌm/结果/The outcome of the election was surprising.
outlet/ˈaʊtlet/出口；插座/There is an electrical outlet near the desk.
outline/ˈaʊtlaɪn/轮廓；大纲/She gave a brief outline of the plan.
output/ˈaʊtpʊt/产量/The factory's output has doubled this year.
outstanding/aʊtˈstændɪŋ/杰出的/She is an outstanding student.
overall/ˌoʊvərˈɔːl/总体的/The overall quality of the product is good.
overcome/ˌoʊvərˈkʌm/克服/She overcame many difficulties in her life.
overlook/ˌoʊvərˈlʊk/俯瞰；忽视/Don't overlook the small details.
overwhelming/ˌoʊvərˈwelmɪŋ/压倒性的/The response was overwhelming.
owe/oʊ/欠/He owes his success to hard work.
pace/peɪs/步伐/The company is growing at a rapid pace.
paradox/ˈpærədɑːks/悖论/It's a paradox that technology both connects and isolates us.
parallel/ˈpærəlel/平行的；类似的/The two roads run parallel to each other.
parameter/pəˈræmɪtər/参数/You need to set the correct parameters.
partial/ˈpɑːrʃl/部分的；偏袒的/The report is partial and unfair.
participate/pɑːrˈtɪsɪpeɪt/参加/All students are encouraged to participate.
particular/pərˈtɪkjələr/特定的/Is there a particular reason for your decision?
passion/ˈpæʃn/激情/She has a passion for music.
passive/ˈpæsɪv/被动的/He is too passive in social situations.
patent/ˈpætnt/专利/He filed a patent for his invention.
pattern/ˈpætərn/模式/The pattern of behavior is very common.
peak/piːk/顶峰/She reached the peak of her career.
peculiar/pɪˈkjuːliər/奇怪的/There is a peculiar smell in the room.
peer/pɪr/同龄人/Peer pressure can influence teenagers.
penalty/ˈpenəlti/处罚/The penalty for breaking the rule is severe.
perceive/pərˈsiːv/感知/She perceived a change in his attitude.
percentage/pərˈsentɪdʒ/百分比/What percentage of students passed the exam?
perception/pərˈsepʃn/认知/People's perception of reality varies.
perform/pərˈfɔːrm/执行/She performed well in the exam.
period/ˈpɪriəd/时期/The exam period lasts for two weeks.
permanent/ˈpɜːrmənənt/永久的/He found a permanent job in the city.
permit/pərˈmɪt/允许/Smoking is not permitted in this area.
persist/pərˈsɪst/坚持/If you persist, you will succeed eventually.
perspective/pərˈspektɪv/视角/We should look at things from different perspectives.
phenomenon/fɪˈnɑːmɪnən/现象/Global warming is a natural phenomenon.
philosophy/fɪˈlɑːsəfi/哲学/He studied philosophy at university.
physical/ˈfɪzɪkl/身体的/Physical exercise is good for health.
pioneer/ˌpaɪəˈnɪr/先驱/She is a pioneer in the field of biotechnology.
policy/ˈpɑːləsi/政策/The government introduced a new education policy.
politics/ˈpɑːlətɪks/政治/He is very interested in politics.
poll/poʊl/民意调查/A recent poll shows that most people support the plan.
population/ˌpɑːpjuˈleɪʃn/人口/The population of the city is over ten million.
portable/ˈpɔːrtəbl/便携的/This portable computer is very convenient.
portion/ˈpɔːrʃn/部分/A large portion of the budget goes to education.
pose/poʊz/造成；摆姿势/The new policy poses a challenge to businesses.
positive/ˈpɑːzətɪv/积极的/She always has a positive attitude.
postpone/poʊstˈpoʊn/推迟/The meeting has been postponed until next week.
potential/pəˈtenʃl/潜力/He has the potential to become a great scientist.
